# DEC-ARC NIGHT env (2026-09-10; Plan_2026-09-10_DEC-ARC_Build.md; PI: Plan A approved 2026-09-10, build audited before it
# hits the pod). ONE spot v6e-8 (2 workers x 4 chips), US zones first, Mumbai last, re-hunted through churn. Arms: D0 D1 =
# the DEC-ARC w160 RI+FPA seed pair · D2 = its plain twin · N0 = the native rg d96 A5-class @40k control (the d96 rung's
# arm). 2-worker map: w0 D0 D2 · w1 D1 N0 (two rounds; the seed pair first). The registered EXTENSION rule on the DEC arms:
# a selected grid inside the last 4k of the budget -> +10k once. Battery per DEC arm through tools/eval_decarc.py (val-hard
# + dev-30: k32 latent restarts, the FPA-start ladder, 8-view vote, colour flip; rg-96 / rt-48 k8; ARC-1 eval k8 + views;
# the final grid on val-hard); N0 through tools/arc_suite.py. RIDER (RIDER=1 in CHAIN_EXTRA_ENV; the PI's reserve gate):
# the champion C2's full-set D64 Sudoku row. LAUNCH PREREQUISITES (the launch procedure in tools/HANDOFF.md): bank
# gs://qhrrn2-rescue/decarc/sets/arc_data.tgz (data/{ARC-AGI,ConceptARC,re_arc,re_gate48,re_gateb48,re_train48}) and
# sets/C2_vsel.pkl (runs/pretrainchamp_C2/ckpt_024000.pkl) before the pilot; the dispatcher's --with-data also syncs
# the data dirs. Walls: pilot 2-3 h (DA_STEPS_DEC=1000-class smoke via the PILOT env below); the night ~ 20-24 h at
# $6.82/h US ($8 Mumbai); cap launch + 30 h. The previous (champion) env is tools/campaign.env (git).
POD=qhrrn2-pod2
ZONES="us-east1-d us-east5-b us-central1-a us-central2-b us-west1-c asia-south1-c"
ACCEL=v6e-8
ACCEL_LIST="v6e-8"
BIG_MAX_STRIKES=99
R_TAG=decarc
R_D=160
R_STEPS=30000
ARMS="D0 D1 D2 N0"
CHAIN_SCRIPT=tools/chain_decarc.sh
CHAIN_EXTRA_ENV="SELF_TEARDOWN=0 C1_WAIT_PASSES=600 RIDER=0"   # RIDER=1 only on the PI's go with the reserve untouched; teardown by hand or the guard
WALL=30600
SENTINEL=CHAIN-DECARC-COMPLETE
GCS=gs://qhrrn2-rescue/decarc
FINAL_OBJ=decarc_final.tgz
CANARY_CKPT=runs/pretrain6_d24/ckpt_latest.pkl
